# 12. APPOINTMENT BOOKING

This is one of the most important features of the website.

Create a simple appointment inquiry system.

Do not build a complicated hospital scheduling system.

The purpose is to allow patients to request appointments and enable the health center to contact them.

## Appointment form

Create a professional appointment form containing:

### Required fields

- Full name.
- Telephone number.
- Preferred service.
- Preferred appointment date.

### Optional fields

- Email address.
- Preferred appointment time.
- Additional message.

Do not request unnecessary medical information.

Do not request sensitive medical records.

### Form functionality

When a patient submits the form:

1. Validate the form.
2. Check that required fields are completed.
3. Save the appointment request to Supabase.
4. Display a confirmation message.
5. Make the inquiry available in the admin dashboard.
6. Provide an optional WhatsApp contact action.

### Confirmation message

"Thank you for contacting Triple T Health Center. Your appointment request has been received. Our team will contact you to confirm availability."

IMPORTANT:

This is an appointment REQUEST.

Do not automatically confirm the appointment.

Do not display a confirmed appointment date unless the health center has actually approved it.

Do not simulate successful database submissions.

Only display success after the request has actually been saved.

Prevent duplicate submissions.

Use a loading state while the request is being processed.

